00:15:32,850 --> 00:15:35,850
 I wonder if it's not cold

286
00:15:35,850 --> 00:15:38,850
 I'm sure someone is crying somewhere

287
00:15:38,850 --> 00:15:43,850
 I want to share my feelings with them

288
00:15:43,850 --> 00:15:48,850
 The scenery that I still don't know is
in front of me

289
00:15:48,850 --> 00:15:53,850
 Look, let's go wherever we want

290
00:15:55,276 --> 00:15:57,376
 Goodbye, goodbye

291
00:15:57,376 --> 00:15:59,376
 Thank you for yesterday

292
00:15:59,376 --> 00:16:03,476
 The city after the rain is colored

293
00:16:03,476 --> 00:16:05,476
 On the canvas of my damaged heart

294
00:16:05,476 --> 00:16:07,676
 I'll draw a fragment of the future

295
00:16:07,676 --> 00:16:12,676
 And guide me

296
00:16:27,642 --> 00:16:32,642
 Now I can say the reason for my tears

297
00:16:32,642 --> 00:16:36,642
 When I'm lost, I remember right away

298
00:16:36,642 --> 00:16:40,642
 Even if it rains, I'll smile

299
00:16:40,642 --> 00:16:44,642
 Look, let's go anywhere

300
00:16:44,642 --> 00:16:48,642
 Goodbye, goodbye, to me of yesterday

301
00:16:48,642 --> 00:16:52,642
 The city lights after the rain are
sparkling

302
00:16:52,642 --> 00:16:54,642
 My heart is like a sunny day

303
00:16:54,642 --> 00:16:57,642
 I'll ring the rainbow bell

304
00:16:57,642 --> 00:17:01,642
 And play the rainbow piano

305
00:17:01,642 --> 00:17:05,642
 Goodbye, goodbye, to me of yesterday

306
00:17:05,642 --> 00:17:09,642
 The city lights after the rain are
sparkling

307
00:17:09,642 --> 00:17:11,642
 My heart is like a sunny day

308
00:17:11,642 --> 00:17:13,642
 I'll wipe away my tears

309
00:17:13,642 --> 00:17:25,642
 And wear a rainbow dress
